# Accepted vulnerabilities for the uFawkes DevSecOps images.
#
# image-release.yml fails on any CRITICAL/HIGH vulnerability that has a fix,
# unless its ID is listed here. Every entry needs a reviewed reason and an
# expiry, one per line above the ID, e.g.:
#
#   # CVE-2026-00000: not reachable (tool never parses untrusted input);
#   # expires 2026-12-31 — re-check at next apt snapshot bump.
#   CVE-2026-00000
#
# Keep this list empty unless a fix is genuinely unavailable to us.
